<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR PRESSURE PAYS OFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR PRESSURE PAYS OFF.</headline>
<dateline>TRABZON, Turkey 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Relentless pressure from Trabzonspor finally cracked Dundee United's solid defence and gave them a 1-0 victory in their UEFA Cup second preliminary round, first leg on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A 78th minute penalty by Hami Mandirali after Kazim Nas was brought down was all that separated the teams despite Trabzonspor's domination.</p>
